{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/137288-terrible-form-question","id":137288,"title":"Terrible Form question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-14T15:57:15-07:00","id":137288,"title":"Terrible Form question","content":"Since Terrible Form is a &quot;style&quot; does that mean you get each dot's benefit on top of each other? For instance having 4 dots in the style, does that give you the benefit of the first dots one extra modification and the second dots extra technology and the third dots extra propulsion and the fourths dots extra process. Or does it only let you have the final dots total in which you spend on demonic forms, for instance you could spend all 4 points on 4 individual modifications or all 4 points on a single extra process?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2460-tazar-yoot","name":"Tazar Yoot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-14T17:31:45-07:00","id":137411,"title":"","content":"It's a style merit. For every dot you get, you get that dot's listed benefit.<br /> <br /> If I have 1 dot, I have one extra Modification. If I have two dots, I get one extra Technology.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-14T18:46:18-07:00","id":137473,"title":"","content":"To be clearer, if you have Terrible Form 1, you have one more Modification than you would if you didn't have any dots in the Merit. If you have Terrible Form 2, you have one more Modification and one more Technology than you would if you didn't have any dots in the Merit. And so on.<br /> <br /> Yeah, it's pretty heavy duty.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}